WEBVTT

00:00:57.436 --> 00:01:01.796
and it's still a green droplet
in the ocean of pollution.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:05.836
I started to campaign
to protect the environment

00:01:05.876 --> 00:01:07.196
and human rights

00:01:07.236 --> 00:01:09.716
when I was at university,

00:01:09.756 --> 00:01:14.436
and I cannot count how many times
I've heard financiers telling me,

00:01:14.476 --> 00:01:16.716
"Sorry, we need coal."

00:01:17.396 --> 00:01:20.276
Sometimes they said,
"We can make it clean."

00:01:21.636 --> 00:01:22.916
Mostly I've heard,

00:01:22.956 --> 00:01:24.396
"It's impossible.

00:01:24.436 --> 00:01:26.596
There is nothing we can do."

00:01:27.236 --> 00:01:28.756
Rather than be discouraged,

00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:31.636
that gave me the strength
to prove them wrong.